    },
    {
      "displayText": "景色不错吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "666F82724E0D95195427FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我去过许多地方旅行，但密阿雷\n这能感受到高度的街景是独一份的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153BB8FC78BB8591A573065B965C5884CFF0C4F465BC6963F96F7000A8FD980FD611F53D752309AD85EA676848857666F662F72EC4E004EFD7684300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要不要和我来场\n有点不一样的宝可梦对战？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89814E0D8981548C62116765573A000A670970B94E0D4E00683776845B9D53EF68A65BF96218FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们都只用\n飞行属性的宝可梦来对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC90FD53EA7528000A98DE884C5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A667655BF96218300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用1只或者几只宝可梦都没问题，\n要不要试试看？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7528003153EA6216800551E053EA5B9D53EF68A690FD6CA195EE9898FF0C000A89814E0D89818BD58BD5770BFF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好只用飞行属性的宝可梦对战了，\n就来跟我说一声如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D53EA752898DE884C5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A65BF962184E86FF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F059824F55FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只带上拥有飞行属性的宝可梦，\n和我一决胜负如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA5E264E0A62E5670998DE884C5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A548C62114E0051B380DC8D1F59824F55FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦！你只带了拥有\n飞行属性的宝可梦过来啦。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那我们这就来对战如何？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF014F6053EA5E264E8662E56709000A98DE884C5C5E602776845B9D53EF68A68FC767655566300200100001BE00000A90A362114EEC8FD95C3167655BF9621859824F55FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF96218FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是想再考虑一下\n用什么宝可梦来对战吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F60F3518D800386514E004E0B000A75284EC04E485B9D53EF68A667655BF962185417FF1F00100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看看谁的宝可梦\n会称霸天空吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B770B8C0176845B9D53EF68A6000A4F1A79F0973859297A7A5427FF0100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只用飞行属性就能这么厉害！\n简直就像天空训练家！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA752898DE884C5C5E60275C3180FD8FD94E4853895BB3FF01000A7B8076F45C3150CF59297A7A8BAD7EC35BB6FF0100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "天空对战啊，\n曾经在卡洛斯地区流行过。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59297A7A5BF96218554AFF0C000A66FE7ECF572853616D1B65AF5730533A6D41884C8FC7300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那是只用能在空中飞的宝可梦，\n以及漂浮在空中的宝可梦<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n来进行的宝可梦对战。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A3662F53EA752880FD57287A7A4E2D98DE76845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A4EE553CA6F026D6E57287A7A4E2D76845B9D53EF68A600100001BE00000A67658FDB884C76845B9D53EF68A65BF96218300200100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "以你的实力，\n一定有机会称霸天空对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EE54F6076845B9E529BFF0C000A4E005B9A6709673A4F1A79F0973859297A7A5BF96218FF0100100002011401480000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样的话，天空对战\n一定也会再次广泛流行起来！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕň",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
